{"id":"cerca","lemma":"cerca","pos":"adv","rank":278,"glosses":["close, near, around, about, nearly, nigh (referring to quantity or time-related)","close, near, around, nigh, at hand, close at hand, in sight (spatially)","nearby, close by"],"ipa":"/ˈθeɾka/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/50/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-cerca.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mira desde más cerca.","en":"Look closer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439114"},{"text":"El amanecer está cerca.","en":"It's nearly dawn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442832"},{"text":"Vive cerca de aquí.","en":"He lives near here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519183"},{"text":"Vive por aquí cerca.","en":"He lives near here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731789"},{"text":"Ven aquí cerca, Tom.","en":"Come over here, Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799322"}]}